    "notes": ["Player-matches with >= 60 valid minutes: 127 of 189 (6 matches; one row per player and match).", "Per-90 values are normalised on measured (valid) time; coverage (valid share of the time on the pitch) median 0.9888, range 0.9437-0.9985. Distances are measured distances (valid speed x dT); estimated gap paths are not included, so the speed-zone distances add up to the total and the ball-status and possession splits add up to the total.", "distance_in_poss_per90_m: own team in possession (provider); distance_out_poss_per90_m: everything else (opponent in possession; possession 'none' does not occur in live play on DFL).", "Sprints: runs of valid samples above 25 km/h lasting >= 1 s. acc_peak_ms2: maximum positive tangential acceleration on valid samples (noise samples of R-ACC-BAND excluded; approx values kept).", "distance_per5min_m: mean over player-matches of the measured distance per 5 minutes of the match clock (time since the period's kickoff; stoppage time beyond 45 min is not binned); a bin counts when the player is on the pitch for >= 95 % of it and >= 90 % of it is measured; distance_per5min_n gives the player-matches per bin.", "Role groups: GK; CB = LCB/CB/RCB; FB = LB/RB/LWB/RWB; DM = CDM/LDM/RDM; CM = LCM/CM/RCM; AM = CAM; W = LW/RW/LM/RM; ST = ST/LS/RS/CF. LM/RM are in W (team decision 2026-10-24): on DFL the only LM/RM (one team, 3-4-1-2) play on the whole flank with winger-like high-speed running.", "Small samples (n < 10 player-matches): ['CM', 'AM']; treat their percentiles as indicative."]
